OL,3,CJudge push for Chloe Mitchell trial to
OL,4,Cbe listed 'as soon as possible'
OL,6,FThe family of Chloe Mitchell have
OL,7,Fwelcomed a judge's statement that he
OL,8,Fwants the trial of a man accused of
OL,9,Fmurdering the Co Antrim woman to be
OL,10,Flisted "as soon as possible".
OL,12,FIn a statement, Ms Mitchell's family
OL,13,Fdescribed it as a "big step forward".
OL,15,FA barrister told Belfast Crown Court
OL,16,Fthat the trial is expected to take
OL,17,Ffour to five weeks.
OL,26,@rD@HOUrD@\O]uD@SOUuD@dO]
