PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786882712
OL,3,CJudge push for Chloe Mitchell trial to
OL,4,Cbe listed 'as soon as possible'
OL,6,FThe case was mentioned on Friday,
OL,7,Fwhere legal teams discussed ongoing
OL,8,Fpsychiatric evaluations of the
OL,9,Faccused, Brandon John Rainey.
OL,11,FMs Mitchell, 21, was found dead in
OL,12,FBallymena, Co Antrim, days after going
OL,13,Fmissing in June 2023.
OL,15,FRainey, 29, formerly of James Street
OL,16,Fin Ballymena, has been charged with
OL,17,Fmurdering Ms Mitchell and attempting
OL,18,Fto prevent the burial of her body.
OL,20,FHe pleaded not guilty to those charges
OL,21,Fat a hearing in 2024.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41703
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786882712
OL,3,CJudge push for Chloe Mitchell trial to
OL,4,Cbe listed 'as soon as possible'
OL,6,FProceedings in the case had already
OL,7,Fbeen delayed in March this year when
OL,8,FRainey parted company with his legal
OL,9,Frepresentatives.
OL,11,FHe subsequently secured different
OL,12,Frepresentation.
OL,14,FA defence barrister told the court on
OL,15,FFriday that a psychiatric report on
OL,16,FRainey was under way and was
OL,17,Fanticipated to be finished by the end
OL,18,Fof the month.
OL,20,FHe also said that a second report may
OL,21,Fbe required.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786882712
OL,3,CJudge push for Chloe Mitchell trial to
OL,4,Cbe listed 'as soon as possible'
OL,6,FProsecuting barrister David Russell KC
OL,7,Fsaid the prosecution had also
OL,8,Fcommissioned a psychological expert to
OL,9,Fexamine Rainey and asked for
OL,10,Fconfirmation that he would agree to
OL,11,Fundergo this evaluation.
OL,13,FHe said that the prosecution would
OL,14,Fneed to see the defence's psychiatric
OL,15,Fassessment of Rainey.
OL,17,FThe judge in the case, Mr Justice
OL,18,FFowler, said the potential of a second
OL,19,Fassessment was a "little bit
OL,20,Fproblematic if one wants to get this
OL,21,Fcase done quickly, which is my desire".
OL,26,@{D@ROU}D@fO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41705
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786882712
OL,3,CJudge push for Chloe Mitchell trial to
OL,4,Cbe listed 'as soon as possible'
OL,6,FThe defence barrister said receiving
OL,7,Fthe first assessment would "put a
OL,8,Fspotlight" on whether the second would
OL,9,Fbe necessary.
OL,11,FMr Justice Fowler said he was "not
OL,12,Fgoing to speculate" on the outcome of
OL,13,Fthat, and asked the defence to remind
OL,14,Fthe expert that this "case is
OL,15,Fpressing, and the judge will expect
OL,16,Fthat deadline to be met on the report".
OL,18,FHe added: "Explain to them that this
OL,19,Fis an important case, and the judge
OL,20,Fwishes to have this matter listed for
OL,21,Ftrial as soon as possible."
OL,26,@oD@\OUpD@JO]sD@_OUtD@SO]vD@VOUxD@fO]zD@
OL,26,AKOU}D@[O]
