OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786882712
OL,3,CJudge push for Chloe Mitchell trial to
OL,4,Cbe listed 'as soon as possible'
OL,6,FMr Russell estimated that the trial
OL,7,Fwould take four to five weeks, and the
OL,8,Fdefence barrister said he felt it
OL,9,Fwould be "shorter than that".
OL,11,FThe judge instructed both legal teams
OL,12,Fto scope out dates for witness
OL,13,Favailability for a trial in October or
OL,14,FNovember.
OL,16,FThe court will sit again on September
OL,17,F13, at which point the judge said he
OL,18,Fhoped to fix a date for trial.
OL,26,@qD@JOUqD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/8
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
