PN,41707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1786882712
OL,3,CJudge push for Chloe Mitchell trial to
OL,4,Cbe listed 'as soon as possible'
OL,6,FIn a statement on social media, Ms
OL,7,FMitchell's family said: "Knowing that
OL,8,Fwe are moving closer to a trial and
OL,9,Fcloser to seeing justice for Chloe
OL,10,Fmeans more than words can explain".
OL,12,FThe statement added: "So today, we
OL,13,Fleft court with a smile on our faces.
OL,14,FNot because any of this is easy, it
OL,15,Fisn't, but because we are finally
OL,16,Fmoving forward.
OL,18,F"We will never stop missing Chloe, and
OL,19,Fnothing will ever take away the pain
OL,20,Fof losing her.
OL,26,@oD@YOUrD@bO]tD@VOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/8
